/* ── TILE NAMES · tracked caps (Cartographic Quiet) ─────────────────────────
   Node, landmark, and expansion sub-tile names go uppercase at their existing
   sizes. Zone names are already uppercased in JS; labels are center-anchored
   SVG text and never width-measured, so case is safe to change here. */
.az-lbl text, .exp-sub text { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

