[data-theme='light'] .fd-rv { color: var(--teal-ink); }
[data-theme='light'] .fd-rv.inc { color: #946905; }
[data-theme='light'] .fd-cv { color: var(--teal-ink); }
[data-theme='light'] .fd-chip:hover { color: #0d1117; border-color: rgba(27,95,168,0.4); }
[data-theme='light'] .fd-link { color: var(--teal-ink); border-color: rgba(27,154,144,0.45); }
[data-theme='light'] .fd-link:hover { background: rgba(27,154,144,0.08); }
[data-theme='light'] .conn-row.active { box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 #1B5FA8; }
[data-theme='light'] .conn-row.active::before { color: #1B5FA8; }
[data-theme='light'] .conn-row.active .conn-row-label { color: #0d1117; }
[data-theme='light'] .conn-row-label { color: rgba(20,40,60,0.9); }
</style>

<noscript><p class="hu-noscript">This tool runs entirely in your browser and needs JavaScript turned on. Nothing you do here is sent to a server.</p></noscript>
<div id="atlas-shell">
  <div id="atlas-tb">
    <span class="atlas-logo tool-bar-title">Healthcare <span>Atlas</span></span>
    <div class="atlas-sep"></div>
    <div id="atlas-bc"><button type="button" class="abc-item active" id="bc-ov">Overview</button></div>
    <div class="atlas-sep"></div>
    <button class="selector" id="atlas-layers-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="atlas-layers-pop" aria-label="Layers">
      <i data-lucide="layers" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sel-val">Layers</span><i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="sel-caret" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
    <div class="atlas-sep"></div>
    <a class="atlas-craft-link" href="/atlas/craft/" title="Atlas Craft: search the atlas and wire your own relationship diagrams">Craft &#8599;</a>
    <div class="atlas-sep"></div>
    <div id="atlas-controls">
      <button class="atlas-btn" id="a-zi" aria-label="Zoom in"><i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
      <button class="atlas-btn" id="a-zo" aria-label="Zoom out"><i data-lucide="minus" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
      <button class="atlas-btn" id="a-rst" aria-label="Reset the view" title="Reset the view"><i data-lucide="crosshair" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
      <button class="atlas-btn" id="a-help" aria-label="How to use" aria-expanded="false" title="How to use"><i data-lucide="help-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h1 class="vh">Healthcare Atlas</h1>
  <div class="vh" id="a11yLive" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>

  <div class="selector-pop" id="atlas-layers-pop" role="dialog" aria-label="Layers and legend" hidden>
    <div class="pop-head"><span class="pop-head-title"><i data-lucide="layers" aria-hidden="true"></i>Layers</span><button class="icon-btn" data-close aria-label="Close"><i data-lucide="x" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div>
    <div class="pop-body">
      <div class="pop-sec">Layers</div>
      <button class="pop-opt" id="af-labels" aria-pressed="true">Zone labels</button>
      <button class="pop-opt" id="af-routes" aria-pressed="true">Routes</button>
      <button class="pop-opt" id="af-expand-all" aria-pressed="false">Expand all</button>
      <button class="pop-opt" id="af-tools" aria-pressed="false">Tool nodes</button>
      <div class="pop-sec">Legend &middot; Connections</div>
      <button class="pop-opt" data-type="clinical" aria-pressed="false"><span class="leg-line" style="color:#4ECDC4"></span>Clinical</button>
      <button class="pop-opt" data-type="financial" aria-pressed="false"><span class="leg-line" style="color:#E8A838"></span>Financial</button>
      <button class="pop-opt" data-type="regulatory" aria-pressed="false"><span class="leg-line" style="color:#8B5CF6"></span>Regulatory</button>
      <button class="pop-opt" data-type="population" aria-pressed="false"><span class="leg-line" style="color:#5DBF87"></span>Population</button>
      <button class="pop-opt" id="leg-conn-popout"><i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>Open connections list</button>
      <div class="pop-sec">Legend &middot; Zones</div>
      <div class="leg-row"><span class="leg-dot" style="background:#FF6B6B"></span><span class="leg-lbl">Med Science</span></div>
      <div class="leg-row"><span class="leg-dot" style="background:#6aabff"></span><span class="leg-lbl">Provider</span></div>
      <div class="leg-row"><span class="leg-dot" style="background:#4ECDC4"></span><span class="leg-lbl">Patient</span></div>
      <div class="leg-row"><span class="leg-dot" style="background:#0EA5E9"></span><span class="leg-lbl">Tech/Eco</span></div>
      <div class="leg-row"><span class="leg-dot" style="background:#8B5CF6"></span><span class="leg-lbl">Policy</span></div>
      <div class="leg-row"><span class="leg-dot" style="background:#5DBF87"></span><span class="leg-lbl">Pub Health</span></div>
      <div class="leg-row"><span class="leg-dot" style="background:#E8A838"></span><span class="leg-lbl">Payer</span></div>
      <div class="pop-sec">Legend &middot; Nodes</div>
      <div class="leg-row">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="-8 -8 16 16" style="flex-shrink:0;opacity:0.75">
          <polyline points="-2.5,-2.5 0,-6 2.5,-2.5" fill="none" stroke="rgba(140,180,215,0.8)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <polyline points="-2.5,2.5 0,6 2.5,2.5"   fill="none" stroke="rgba(140,180,215,0.8)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <polyline points="2.5,-2.5 6,0 2.5,2.5"   fill="none" stroke="rgba(140,180,215,0.8)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <polyline points="-2.5,-2.5 -6,0 -2.5,2.5" fill="none" stroke="rgba(140,180,215,0.8)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="leg-lbl">Expandable</span>
      </div>
      <div class="leg-row">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="-8 -8 16 16" style="flex-shrink:0;opacity:0.75">
          <path d="M-3.5,-3.5 L3.5,3.5 M3.5,-3.5 L-3.5,3.5" fill="none" stroke="rgba(140,180,215,0.5)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="leg-lbl">&#9670; Landmark</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="atlas-desk-hint" hidden>
    <span>Full Atlas experience is best on a desktop screen.</span>
    <button id="adh-x" aria-label="Dismiss">×</button>
  </div>
  <div class="applied-strip" id="atlas-applied" hidden></div>
  <div id="atlas-canvas">
    <svg id="atlas-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"></svg>
    <div class="chart-corners" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div id="atlas-stamp" aria-hidden="true">HU ATLAS &middot; UNIFIED DATASET</div>
    <div id="atlas-hint"><span class="hint-mouse">Scroll to zoom · Drag to pan · Click any hex to explore</span><span class="hint-touch">Pinch to zoom · Drag to pan · Tap any hex to explore</span></div>
    <div id="conn-tooltip"><div class="ctt-label" id="ctt-label"></div><div class="ctt-desc" id="ctt-desc"></div></div>
  </div>
  <div id="atlas-conn" class="hu-ticks">
    <div id="conn-hdr">
      <span id="conn-hdr-title">Connections</span>
      <button id="conn-panel-close" aria-label="Close connections">×</button>
    </div>
    <input id="conn-search" type="text" aria-label="Search connections" placeholder="Search connections…" autocomplete="off">
    <div id="conn-filters">
      <button class="cf-chip on" data-type="all">All</button>
      <button class="cf-chip" data-type="clinical">Clinical</button>
      <button class="cf-chip" data-type="financial">Financial</button>
      <button class="cf-chip" data-type="regulatory">Regulatory</button>
      <button class="cf-chip" data-type="population">Population</button>
    </div>
    <div id="conn-list"></div>
    <div id="conn-empty">No connections match.</div>
  </div>

  <div id="atlas-find">
    <div id="find-bar">
      <i data-lucide="search" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <input id="find-input" aria-label="Search the atlas" type="text" placeholder="Search the whole atlas: roles, facilities, metrics, suppliers, concepts…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
      <span id="find-count"></span>
    </div>
    <div id="find-results"></div>
    <div id="find-detail"></div>
    <div id="atlas-hud" class="hu-ticks">
      <div id="hud-grip"></div>
      <div id="hud-inner">
        <div id="hud-id">
          <div class="hud-badge" id="h-badge"></div>
          <div class="hud-ktype" id="h-type"></div>
          <div id="hud-title"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="hud-body">
          <div id="hud-desc-col"><div id="hud-desc"></div><div id="hud-data" style="display:none"></div></div>
          <div id="hud-links-col">
            <div class="hud-lhdr">Connected</div>
            <div id="hud-links"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button id="hud-close" aria-label="Close detail card">×</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="atlas-help" class="hu-ticks">
    <div id="help-hdr">
      <span id="help-hdr-title">How to Use</span>
      <button id="help-close" aria-label="Close help">×</button>
    </div>
    <div id="help-body">
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">Navigation</div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">⊕</span><span class="help-text"><strong>Scroll</strong> to zoom in or out on the map.</span></div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">✥</span><span class="help-text"><strong>Drag</strong> to pan across the map canvas.</span></div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">⊙</span><span class="help-text">The <strong>crosshair button</strong> in the toolbar snaps back to the full overview.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">Exploring Nodes</div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">◆</span><span class="help-text"><strong><span class="hint-mouse">Click any hex</span><span class="hint-touch">Tap any hex</span></strong> to open its detail card.</span></div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">⤢</span><span class="help-text"><strong>Landmark nodes</strong> expand into sub-nodes when selected. Look for the chevron markers.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">Connections</div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">─</span><span class="help-text"><strong>Hover any route line</strong> to see the relationship between two zones.</span></div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">◉</span><span class="help-text">Route colors indicate type: <strong>teal</strong> = clinical, <strong>gold</strong> = financial, <strong>purple</strong> = regulatory, <strong>green</strong> = population.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">Layers &amp; Legend</div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">≡</span><span class="help-text">The <strong>Layers</strong> button in the toolbar opens one panel with every layer toggle plus the map legend.</span></div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">≡</span><span class="help-text"><strong>Zone labels</strong> toggles the zone name overlays. <strong>Routes</strong> shows or hides all connection lines between zones.</span></div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">≡</span><span class="help-text"><strong>Tool nodes</strong> highlights hexes that link to interactive tools on this site.</span></div>
        <div class="help-item"><span class="help-icon" aria-hidden="true">≡</span><span class="help-text">Anything switched away from its default shows as a chip under the toolbar. Hit its ✕ to restore.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

